; didgpu_cuda.def — exported C-ABI symbols of didgpu_cuda.dll
; Regenerated (the original is git-ignored via .gitignore `/src/*.def`).
; These are the extern "C" entry points defined in src/cuda_*.cu and
; imported by didgpu.dll across the pure-C ABI boundary.
